Spore Card — a PNG card that is a seed.
Powered by the Konomi architecture, created by Thomas Frumkin.

Vendored, credited:
- spore.mjs, organ.mjs  — sjgant80-hub/fall-spore (MIT): the seed format and germination engine.
- png.mjs               — sjgant80-hub/fallkard-forge (MIT): PNG chunk primitives (lossless layer).
- .witness/witness.mjs  — the mutation gate engine (claudedidy / sjgant80-hub), vendored and credited.

Bundled data:
- data/online_shoppers_intention.csv — UCI "Online Shoppers Purchasing Intention Dataset".
  Used to reproduce the sealed held-out AUC locally when a card is grown.

The NEW code in this repo is spore-card.mjs (the card codec) and spore-card-wire.mjs (browser glue).
